wls, and last-stand defenses where every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.poster.avif?t=1771937551\" width=544 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.webm?t=1771937551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/extras/66d856c3972f8344b9ba5021f03a9b55.mp4?t=1771937551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your own squad. Issue orders and coordinate your unit to outmaneuver and outgun the enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Armoured Dudes \u7532\u58eb"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579070/00b24546af013ee7b3ee7268cd2781cd02cfdb3a/header.jpg?t=1771937551","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579070/657757184/31b3047832522f2a1e82fbf898d746c9a6bf1e6a/1755909320/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755983999","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579070/657757184/31b3047832522f2a1e82fbf898d746c9a6bf1e6a/1755909320/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755983999","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3579070/657757184/31b3047832522f2a1e82fbf898d746c9a6bf1e6a/1755909320/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755983999","id":257187459,"name":"Disposable Corps Gameplay Trailer TPS","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187